<p>Within radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4,</acronym> transfer heat from a group of enemies bodies to their equipment, freezing them to the floor while the excess heat disables their weapons and armor.</p><p>Those afflicted will be dealt <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">47, 63, 75, 86, 95</acronym> Cold and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">47, 63, 75, 86, 95</acronym> Fire damage, and be pinned (Frozen Feet) and disarmed for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns.</p><p>Targets suffering both types of damage will also have have their Armour and saves reduced by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">11, 14, 17, 20, 22.</acronym></p><p>The chance to apply the effects and the duration increase with your Mindpower.</p>